Subject: [PATCH] Turn the user menu into a shared Menu with hover highlighting

## What

The user menu is built from the shared Menu and its Menu Item, with hover highlighting on items.

## Why

The designer's consistency pass (design-consistency-pass) changed the User Menu to use the same Menu Item as the right-click menu, with only the hovered item highlighted.

## Changes

- Updated HomePage.tsx to use MenuItem with size="compact" to match the redesigned Menu Item component
- Changed the Sign out icon size from 16px to 14px to match the compact size specification
- Added e2e test case 'Given the user menu is open, when I hover "Sign out", then only "Sign out" is highlighted' to verify hover highlighting

## Testing

All existing tests pass, plus new test for hover highlighting:
- apps/web/e2e/user-menu.spec.ts:84 - hover highlighting verification
- apps/web/e2e/user-menu.spec.ts:3 - user menu shows name, email, and Sign out

